Z||000000||mrgone||06-19-2001||08:17 PM||||my door makes a loud thunking sound when i go over bumps on the road, like the door has room to move up when its closed, when i push hard on the door and go over a bump it doesnt make the door move and thunk.<P>how do i make the door not... thunk.<P>i know theres a stub it closes on, and mine looks like its striking a little low  is this how i adjust the door close height<P><BR>i also have a buzzing sound coming from both rear speaker panels when the car is at a certian rpm that makes the car shake a bit and its really loud and annoying. my third brake light used to do it but i took off the screws and covered them in silicone and put them and it seemed to make the brake light stop vibrating.<P>but the main concern is the doors thunking||||reg||11
Z||000001||84Bill||06-19-2001||09:25 PM||||Sounds like you need to renew the hinges. It should make both door problems go away.<BR>I don't really understand <BR><B>i also have a buzzing sound coming from both rear speaker panels when the car is at a certian rpm that makes the car shake a bit and its really loud and annoying </B><P>If the car shakes it could be out of balanced tire but I dont understand the realation to the buzzing in the speakers<P><p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 06-19-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroFanaticus2||06-19-2001||10:09 PM||||sounds like it could be just the hinge pins and bushing instead of the entire hinge.<BR>If you need a set of pins and bushings I happen to have an extra set and would be willing to part with them, just email me.||||reg||1
Z||000003||c m west||06-19-2001||11:04 PM||||it is not the hinges - your problem is that the rubber that surrounds the latch bolt when the door is closed is no longer existent - your option is to replace the latching mechanism which will have new rubber, or get by for now by pulling out the latch bolt and slip on a piece of rubber tubing<P> You can replace the hinges but I can promise you it will not cure the noise<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
